1
00:00:00,912 --> 00:00:02,682
(Mary:)Oh, it's my pleasure. Mm.

2
00:00:02,680 --> 00:00:04,310
(Mary:)I'm so glad y'all could make it.

3
00:00:04,315 --> 00:00:05,745
(Mary:)So, tell me,
what's going on back home?

4
00:00:05,750 --> 00:00:09,320
(Amy:)Well, uh, Howard and Bernadette
had their baby.

5
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:11,520
Oh, that's wonderful!

6
00:00:11,523 --> 00:00:16,693
(Mary:)Now, have they decided
to raise it Jewish or regular?

7
00:00:20,698 --> 00:00:22,968
(Sheldon:)Welcome to Texas.

8
00:00:22,967 --> 00:00:26,237
(Amy:)They haven't said.

9
00:00:27,338 --> 00:00:28,638
(Amy:)Anyway, we, uh, we also have

10
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:30,370
(Amy:)some exciting news to share.

11
00:00:30,375 --> 00:00:32,875
(Sheldon:)Oh, wait, wait...
I... Shouldn't we just eat?

12
00:00:32,877 --> 00:00:35,677
(Sheldon:)You know, I mean, God did take
time out of his busy schedule

13
00:00:35,680 --> 00:00:37,950
(Sheldon:)to bless these Sloppy Joes.

14
00:00:37,949 --> 00:00:40,149
(Mary:)Come on, Shelly,
tell me your news.

15
00:00:40,151 --> 00:00:42,881
(Sheldon:)All right. This is on you.

16
00:00:42,887 --> 00:00:47,287
(Sheldon:)Amy and I are living together
in sin,

17
00:00:47,292 --> 00:00:50,562
(Sheldon:)like a couple of New Yorkers.

18
00:00:50,562 --> 00:00:54,232
(Sheldon:)Now, while you scold us, I'm
going to get a knife and a fork.

19
00:00:54,232 --> 00:00:56,262
(Sheldon:)Joe may be sloppy,
but Sheldon's not.

20
00:00:58,570 --> 00:01:00,570
(Mary:)Well, thank you
for letting me know,

